@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Method / document navigation. Scope-independent process/navigation; provider or runner examples are not MVP prerequisites.
title Proposed — Contract-first refinement without mandatory code generation
!pragma useVerticalIf on
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

start
:Identify source criteria, owner, real consumers and exact meaning;
:Draft operation, authority, inputs/results and repetition/compatibility rules;
:Choose contract representation appropriate to actual interface;
fork
 :Review consumer expectations / denial / conflict / unknown paths;
fork again
 :Review owner invariants / persistence / external effect boundaries;
end fork
:Reconcile contract and planned checks;
if (Mock or code generation actually justified?) then (yes)
 :Generate only from identified authoritative source / compatible toolchain;
 :Retain generator identity and limitations;
else (no)
 :Implement bounded contract directly when authorized;
endif
:Verify actual provider and consumer against same contract candidate;
:Record evidence, compatibility limits and actual disposition;
stop

@enduml
